{"4448700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Agraria", "steam_appid": 4448700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Agraria!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/extras/046637d4e86f6be80d4bf08da0441ab6.avif?t=1782100656\" width=798 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build a Quiet Life on the Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the crowded city? Ready to start a new, isolated life where you can focus on building the farm of your dreams? Become a Shared Land Agricultural Engineer at Agraria Inc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got Shared Land Partnership Plots ready to go RIGHT NOW! They might start small, but through the magic of our proprietary Cultivation Motivation 3000 program, you'll quickly work your way through the ranks. Complete specific agricultural trials to grow your fields and unlock an amazing assortment of new seeds, tools, livestock, and technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being an Agricultural Engineer at Agraria is all about the relaxing routine of hands-on farming. You'll start with just a small field - tilling, sowing, watering, weeding, fertilizing, and harvesting by hand. As your farm expands, you'll find new ways to stay efficient, but you never lose that hand-on feel that makes farming feel cozy, even when you're building an agricultural empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best of all, Agraria Inc. will take care of you every step of the way, delivering everything you need so you can keep working, growing, and improving. This isn't a job for extroverts! Enjoy a quiet life on the farm without interruption. (Okay, maybe occasional visits from Lars, our overeager junior inspector, but he's mostly harmless).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/extras/4e21d4622c8b04cb02245ba5d7841884.avif?t=1782100656\" width=300 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Agraria Takes Care of its Partners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you sign up with Agraria Inc, you get*:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 Total Crops - 27 Regular Crops, Grapes, 4 Orchard Fruits, and 10 Wild Crops you can find and add to your farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal Economics - Grow crops year-round in the mild climate of Agraria Valley; seasons affect demand, supply, and market factors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees, Chickens, and Sheep - Get into profitable animal husbandry with honey, eggs, and wool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple production methods, including manual canning, dehydration, brewing, and factory production - over 100 recipes total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple types of fertilizers for higher grade crops. The right tool for the right growth cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated Irrigation - Sprinklers that do more than spray water. Load them up with fertilizer or herbicide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organic farming - Monitor your soil to ensure premium organic produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power push tools to speed up your chores - Seeder, Cultivator, and Harvester.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unique radio stations, including hours of custom in-game podcasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cutting edge PotatOS 2.7 Agricultural Computer System, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email - stay in touch with your helpful Agraria Inc. partners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AgShop - Your one-stop shop for seeds, supplies, tools, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CM3K - Professional development made easy. Rise through 8 ranks of agricultural mastery over 47 trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MarketWatch - Get detailed data about market trends, current prices, predicted fluctuations, and seasonal demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plotzo - Expand your farm by purchasing new and bigger plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GigFarmer - Take private contracts with locals for special, high-value rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agraria Inc. Portal - Company info, tutorials, and currency exchange.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*For qualified S.L.A.E.s only. New partners receive a hoe, a watering can, a basket, and six turnip seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/extras/cc994e40d6a4a0cb9a5db2514005adb5.avif?t=1782100656\" width=300 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agraria is a cozy farming game that keeps the focus on the farm. No social commitments, no town to wander through, no birthdays to remember, no epic quest for glory. Its got a lot of personality, though (maybe TOO much - I'm looking at you, Lars). But almost all social aspects can be ignored or minimized if you want to just focus on farming.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Agraria!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/extras/046637d4e86f6be80d4bf08da0441ab6.avif?t=1782100656\" width=798 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build a Quiet Life on the Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the crowded city? Ready to start a new, isolated life where you can focus on building the farm of your dreams? Become a Shared Land Agricultural Engineer at Agraria Inc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got Shared Land Partnership Plots ready to go RIGHT NOW! They might start small, but through the magic of our proprietary Cultivation Motivation 3000 program, you'll quickly work your way through the ranks. Complete specific agricultural trials to grow your fields and unlock an amazing assortment of new seeds, tools, livestock, and technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being an Agricultural Engineer at Agraria is all about the relaxing routine of hands-on farming. You'll start with just a small field - tilling, sowing, watering, weeding, fertilizing, and harvesting by hand. As your farm expands, you'll find new ways to stay efficient, but you never lose that hand-on feel that makes farming feel cozy, even when you're building an agricultural empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best of all, Agraria Inc. will take care of you every step of the way, delivering everything you need so you can keep working, growing, and improving. This isn't a job for extroverts! Enjoy a quiet life on the farm without interruption. (Okay, maybe occasional visits from Lars, our overeager junior inspector, but he's mostly harmless).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/extras/4e21d4622c8b04cb02245ba5d7841884.avif?t=1782100656\" width=300 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Agraria Takes Care of its Partners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you sign up with Agraria Inc, you get*:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 Total Crops - 27 Regular Crops, Grapes, 4 Orchard Fruits, and 10 Wild Crops you can find and add to your farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal Economics - Grow crops year-round in the mild climate of Agraria Valley; seasons affect demand, supply, and market factors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees, Chickens, and Sheep - Get into profitable animal husbandry with honey, eggs, and wool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple production methods, including manual canning, dehydration, brewing, and factory production - over 100 recipes total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple types of fertilizers for higher grade crops. The right tool for the right growth cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated Irrigation - Sprinklers that do more than spray water. Load them up with fertilizer or herbicide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organic farming - Monitor your soil to ensure premium organic produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power push tools to speed up your chores - Seeder, Cultivator, and Harvester.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unique radio stations, including hours of custom in-game podcasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cutting edge PotatOS 2.7 Agricultural Computer System, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email - stay in touch with your helpful Agraria Inc. partners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AgShop - Your one-stop shop for seeds, supplies, tools, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CM3K - Professional development made easy. Rise through 8 ranks of agricultural mastery over 47 trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MarketWatch - Get detailed data about market trends, current prices, predicted fluctuations, and seasonal demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plotzo - Expand your farm by purchasing new and bigger plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GigFarmer - Take private contracts with locals for special, high-value rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agraria Inc. Portal - Company info, tutorials, and currency exchange.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*For qualified S.L.A.E.s only. New partners receive a hoe, a watering can, a basket, and six turnip seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/extras/cc994e40d6a4a0cb9a5db2514005adb5.avif?t=1782100656\" width=300 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agraria is a cozy farming game that keeps the focus on the farm. No social commitments, no town to wander through, no birthdays to remember, no epic quest for glory. Its got a lot of personality, though (maybe TOO much - I'm looking at you, Lars). But almost all social aspects can be ignored or minimized if you want to just focus on farming.</p>", "short_description": "Some days you just want to dig in the dirt and watch something grow. Agraria gets it. Build your dream farm at your own pace - tilling, planting, harvesting, and slowly building an agricultural empire - all under the caring, non-intrusive guidance of Agraria Inc. (Terms and conditions may apply.)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/90624c6e50bc5b7af769642ccc3f990723a3868a/header.jpg?t=1782100656", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/eddd346b205a9250c21f6166852f2eee59ae24dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782100656", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4448700/eddd346b205a9250c21f6166852f2eee59ae24dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782100656", "we